  x `buildc-org` is not a collection this repository declares
  help: a repository is seedable only if it publishes its own components/ as a
        collection, and declares it in `sources` under the owner they are
        imported as: that is what a seeded repository fetches them through

  x `core/hello` is in no collection the seed can name
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-seed/example.image.kdl:9:9]
  8 |     core {
  9 |         hello
    :         ^^|^^
    :           `-- `buildc-org` is not declared in `sources`
 10 |     }
    `----
  help: a seed lists a component by name and nothing else, so one nothing can
        import leaves a seeded repository unbuildable
